%% TRIP-013 Charter: Destination pages and search
%% The main flow and its error paths. Label steps with requirement IDs where it helps.
flowchart TD
    A[Traveller opens /charter] --> B[Start cards Plats and Aktivitet, all destinations: R3]
    B -->|Plats: continent| C[Countries of the continent]
    C -->|country| F
    B -->|Antarktis or a category| F
    B -->|types in the search field| S[Suggestions from /api/destination-search: R1]
    S -->|arrow keys and Enter, or click| P
    S -->|Enter or Sök| F
    B -->|filters| F[List filtered by search and filters, address updated: R1, R2]
    F --> G{Any match?}
    G -- no --> H[Inga destinationer matchar, offer to clear: R1]
    H --> B
    G -- yes --> I[Destination cards: R5]
    I -->|Visa| P[/charter/id: R7]
    P --> Q{Flights?}
    Q -- yes --> R[Price från, airport and distance: R6, R7]
    Q -- no --> T[Red notice, no price: R8]
    P -->|unknown id| N[404 page with link to the list]
    P -->|Tillbaka till listan| F
